{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "28149189e43e17ae678534d2b9e6093cbcaacd02f27ee45516c5a7b7c620f7af", "ja": "妖精たちの飛翔！", "zh": "妖精们的飞翔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d71675b90845f7a7233816a09d300ea5a3c02a23aab88e9b531c52fedd22d64c", "ja": "Fairyチームのお披露目公演直前。\nオープニングを務める\nFAIRY STARSの面々は、\n今日まで経験してきたものに思いを馳せ、\n仲間の想いを背にステージに立つ。", "zh": "Fairy队的首次亮相公演开始前，\n负责开场的FAIRY STARS成员\n回想起至今经历的点点滴滴，\n背负着伙伴们的心意站上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f49421ebb0e357c1bdc78190a702a9791974df26367326e07af00979398311be", "ja": "（ついに、Fairyチームのお披露目公演が始まる。\nここまで届く歓声の数々……客席は満員御礼だ！）", "zh": "（Fairy队的首次亮相公演终于要开始了，\n许多欢呼声传递到了这里来……观众席全部客满！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e959954d19bd95eb4ba9a47b561854cbe2399c4cbce89c184ff15cdc53643f36", "ja": "今日はみんな、リハーサルから完ぺきだったな。\n本番もこの調子で頼む！", "zh": "今天大家从排练开始就很完美呢，\n正式演出也拜托你们继续保持了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fc386072c0e974a64d60f07e7d47935cfd219bb2b22328c1ff265b9363160916", "ja": "本番を迎える私達に、さらに重圧をかけてくるなんて。\nあなたは……鬼ですか？", "zh": "竟然对迎接正式演出的我们施加压力，\n请问……你是魔鬼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b4dcc94a2db038d4f2eaec39966b74f671fbe04b81da540d1f99c3c0fb10dc7e", "ja": "ち、違う違う。\nそうじゃなくて、ええと……。", "zh": "不、不是不是，\n我不是这个意思，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "74921a86286fe7890765fd2dc1969216d4e379afdd58d27fa1499215e90c2260", "ja": "にゃははっ！　今のは{$P$}なりに、\n頑張れ～って気合いを入れてくれたんだよ～。", "zh": "呀哈哈！刚刚那是{$P$}\n用他的方式鼓励我们表演加油啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "30067c869d094643b223d9dcf25339fea7d94a7f974286a025b92fd6b53e94a9", "ja": "そ……っ。それなら、そうと言ってください。\n今は私、あまり……余裕がなくて……。", "zh": "既……既然如此，就请直接说清楚。\n我现在真的……没有什么余力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a49d923270ea20813024a0bd238dd2a0bb9b94f2aebd6bf6ba8fdaba4053803b", "ja": "いや、もっとわかりやすく言うべきだった。\nつまり……。", "zh": "不，我应该讲得更清楚一点的。\n也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "132451c6eb0bc493f9f600f22988512d91d08805909cf771bc1d02940c10c300", "ja": "今日のみんなは、バッチリだ！\n自信もって行こう！", "zh": "大家今天都很完美！\n带着自信上台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "8289bb60ef0d506221781f13e8b4d2929bbed15e7c12951676e62946e66a7d1a", "ja": "うん♪　チラシ配りの時みたいに、\nみんなでステージを盛り上げちゃお～！", "zh": "嗯♪就像发传单的时候一样，\n大家一起炒热舞台的气氛吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f849d5619d6c641258137c69133adfec7798e5d83c48165bacfcde6e46a9589a", "ja": "はい……。思いきって踏み出した一歩は、\n届くと……信じます。", "zh": "好的……\n我相信下定决心踏出的步伐……一定能触及的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "c4ce07e10832743c00e3a251fbeb2812d663f77988b94ef78169a67bf28daa4c", "ja": "憧れのステージで輝けると信じて、\n頑張ってきた……仲間のみんなと一緒に！", "zh": "我相信可以在憧憬的舞台上大放光彩，\n和一路努力过来的……伙伴们一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "588a01d301fa1ece58e83fc715ca7a5e188dc9e92e37f13a80d69ca0142c2966", "ja": "ああ、最高にロックなステージにしようぜ！", "zh": "是啊，一起展现最摇滚的表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "2d9c526d01a443cf2ecb561e4491891355db7c01d870134539f6563dd5454474", "ja": "ん？　シホ、どうした？", "zh": "嗯？志保，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "026803a1a03192920f311e51a09ef885e152dd99bece0c0b71146d4fbe68d78d", "ja": "いえ、何のためでも、どんな方法でもいいと思って。\n目指す結果は同じですし。", "zh": "没事，我想不管是为了什么、用什么方法都好，\n毕竟追求的结果都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "16a5dfabc4e21776be0df454c2f72046d68fa87926ad51dadefd5687d7dc51c8", "ja": "そうだな。でも、この公演はFairyチームのゴール\nじゃなくて、スタートだ。それを忘れないでくれ。", "zh": "是啊，但是这场公演不是Fairy队的终点，\n而是起点，别忘了这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
