{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "3986fc169b8234ae901616ce9a8b2ec3e6f046927452e8b23a877895dc1fd993", "ja": "さあ、開幕の時間だ。\nFairy公演、思いっきり楽しんでこい！", "zh": "好，开幕的时间到了。\n大家尽情享受Fairy公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1d19cbcbaa7c4a59d78f3c9351ddb9ecded08b62cd7b52a3f80ef13db35cfde9", "ja": "楽しんで……そうですね。\n行きましょう、最上さん。", "zh": "享受……没错呢。\n我们走吧，最上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "be60a35d0e8fdd863a7bdb000185480313d8924cd260d576348ca9421dce8e6b", "ja": "はいっ！　今の私たちの全部を、\nお客さんに届けに！", "zh": "好！把现在的我们的一切，\n全都传递给观众！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3061493ed9f597ac7c845051e58be69782c05208aef2f416aafa7b02789a9620", "ja": "（Fairyのみんなで作り上げる公演……。\n開幕のステージに、5人のアイドルが並び立つ）", "zh": "（由Fairy的各位所打造的公演……\n五位偶像并排站在开幕的舞台上。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0011_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_06_1026_p", "source_sha256": "32bc598a902beeb8e0b6bd7254ec75f560005becd04cca1be326691801a8c62e", "ja": "（夢をつかむため、願いをかなえるために。\nはるかな高みに舞い上がるために！）", "zh": "（为了抓住梦想、为了实现愿望，\n为了朝遥远的顶点飞舞而上！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
